WEBVTT

00:00:01.675 --> 00:00:03.928
Run, Red Lightning!

00:00:04.011 --> 00:00:06.096
Run, Detective Manami!

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.432
Run, Detective Aoi!

00:00:08.516 --> 00:00:12.937
These two young detectives stand
resolute against heinous crimes.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:16.148
With their revolvers hidden in
their skirts and sneakers,

00:00:16.232 --> 00:00:17.775
whether they're running hot or cool,

00:00:17.858 --> 00:00:19.944
they keep their passion for
the investigation under wraps,

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:22.530
It's a golden young action drama.

00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:25.115
Detectives Manami and Aoi.

00:00:25.199 --> 00:00:27.535
Starring Tomatsu Haruka
as Kinjoh Manami,

00:00:27.618 --> 00:00:29.870
Hanazawa Kana as Futaba Aoi,

00:00:29.954 --> 00:00:32.373
Tamura Mutsumi as Kio, the informant,

00:00:32.456 --> 00:00:34.917
and Ito Kanae as Captain Eris.

00:00:42.716 --> 00:00:44.468
I'm still inexperienced

00:00:44.552 --> 00:00:50.266
There are many answers before my eyes

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:57.481
How many equal parts
can you divide one sky into?

00:00:57.565 --> 00:00:59.358
Give me them all,
because they're so much fun

00:00:59.441 --> 00:01:01.110
I want them all to myself

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:04.530
My true colors spill into the blue sky

00:01:04.613 --> 00:01:12.246
Man! I'll write your
name down so I don't lose it

00:01:12.329 --> 00:01:14.039
Why don't you get serious?

00:01:14.123 --> 00:01:19.295
I won't let you tell me you don't like to

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:26.051
A pure love device (Set up now) and start it up

00:01:26.135 --> 00:01:30.139
On a runway of impatience and dreams

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:34.018
fasten your seatbelt even tighter

00:01:34.101 --> 00:01:40.899
A cutting-edge device
(Back up now) it's starting up

00:01:40.983 --> 00:01:44.945
I want the original

00:01:45.029 --> 00:01:48.616
of your heart, at least,

00:01:48.699 --> 00:01:52.620
and I've put together a plan

00:01:56.999 --> 00:02:00.878
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.927
This is the Saitama Super Arena.

00:02:09.011 --> 00:02:13.807
An adjustable event hall that can
accommodate up to 37,000 people.

00:02:14.725 --> 00:02:16.393
Here, at this moment, once again,

00:02:16.477 --> 00:02:20.147
a certain group is holding
a top-secret gathering.

00:02:23.192 --> 00:02:25.027
"Hallo"

00:02:25.527 --> 00:02:27.488
Mee-ow!!

00:02:28.197 --> 00:02:30.240
"I'm glad you all could coms™

00:02:30.532 --> 00:02:32.701
Mee-ow!!

00:02:33.285 --> 00:02:35.245
"Than) you, everyone"

00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:37.790
Mee-ow!!

00:02:38.457 --> 00:02:40.668
"The Mastoar was suposed to b9 here, too,

00:02:40.751 --> 00:02:41.794
but some things came up,
and shs couldn't maje it"

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:47.257
Er, it says, "The Master
was supposed to be here, too,

00:02:47.341 --> 00:02:51.970
but some things came up,
and she couldn't make it."

00:02:52.054 --> 00:02:55.265
Instead, we have a
satellite uplink in place,

00:02:55.349 --> 00:02:58.686
so please watch this message.

00:02:58.769 --> 00:03:01.438
Friends, it has been too long.

00:03:03.524 --> 00:03:07.569
We in the kitty-ear ranks of
the Underside of the Kitten's Paw

00:03:07.653 --> 00:03:10.739
have been successful
in welcoming Miss Eris.

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:15.077
However, Miss Eris
has given us a provision.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.246
You could even call it a trial.

00:03:18.414 --> 00:03:21.333
We have worshipped
cats' ears and tails,

00:03:21.417 --> 00:03:25.671
hoping that someday,
we would be reborn into such bodies.

00:03:25.754 --> 00:03:30.884
<i>However, Miss Eris has declared
that we bring an end to that era!</i>

00:03:32.761 --> 00:03:35.139
She has proclaimed that
we cease to worship kitty ears,

00:03:35.222 --> 00:03:38.892
and that we are to all live together!

00:03:40.436 --> 00:03:44.148
Indeed! It is true!
There are beings in this universe

00:03:44.231 --> 00:03:48.026
that possess real kitty ears and tails.

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:53.198
This is no illusion! As such,
we shall cease to pursue this dream,

00:03:53.282 --> 00:03:57.161
and seek to live a reality
that approaches the ideal!

00:03:57.244 --> 00:03:58.746
Miss Eris...

00:03:58.829 --> 00:04:04.543
U-Um... Hello, everyone. Uh, I'm Eris.

00:04:05.627 --> 00:04:10.591
So there you have it.
Let's all please get along together.

00:04:10.674 --> 00:04:15.596
Mee-ow!! Mee-ow!! Mee-ow!!

00:04:16.513 --> 00:04:18.599
Was that good enough?

00:04:18.682 --> 00:04:20.934
Of course it was, Miss Eris!

00:04:21.018 --> 00:04:24.813
By doing this, we'll gradually
secularize the order,

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:28.066
and then we can bring it down
until it's at a fan-club level, right?

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.985
Well, yes, but...

00:04:30.068 --> 00:04:34.156
It looks like the religious
atmosphere is even stronger now.

00:04:47.169 --> 00:04:51.298
This is a quasi-antimatter round
that was supplied by Catia.

00:04:51.381 --> 00:04:53.217
It creates a
quasi-annihilation reaction

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.303
that is able to annihilate
only non-living matter.

00:04:56.386 --> 00:04:58.055
That's the same stuff that is in

00:04:58.138 --> 00:05:00.390
the Pico-Pico hammers
and the toy guns, right?

00:05:00.474 --> 00:05:03.393
It allows you to disarm an
opponent without hurting them,

00:05:03.477 --> 00:05:05.395
so you can shoot them without worry.

00:05:05.479 --> 00:05:07.981
I'll start by showing
you how to hold it, okay?

00:05:08.065 --> 00:05:09.566
Show me your grip.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.026
Mm-hmm.

00:05:14.279 --> 00:05:17.699
Yes. Aim with both of your eyes open.

00:05:17.783 --> 00:05:21.453
If you close one of your eyes,
it lets the gun create a blind spot.

00:05:23.205 --> 00:05:26.208
Good, good, they're getting along fine.

00:05:27.501 --> 00:05:30.587
Oh, you're talking
about spiritron force, right?

00:05:30.671 --> 00:05:34.132
Mm-hmm. It gives the spirit
particles a fixed direction,

00:05:34.216 --> 00:05:37.052
and then has them
perform various transductions.

00:05:37.135 --> 00:05:39.596
So by using basic circuits
burned in by willpower,

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:42.349
you're able to manifest different phenomena.

00:05:42.432 --> 00:05:45.269
This certainly is a kind of magic.

00:05:46.186 --> 00:05:50.399
Any sufficiently advanced technology
is indistinguishable from magic.

00:05:50.482 --> 00:05:52.609
They're both universal principles,

00:05:52.693 --> 00:05:55.487
so at their root, they're the same.

00:05:58.657 --> 00:06:01.201
Oh... Can I have some tea, too?

00:06:04.413 --> 00:06:07.124
Have you had enough training already?

00:06:08.292 --> 00:06:11.920
Yeah, well, right now, Aoi is training.

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:15.549
Oh, I thought Aoi was
the one doing the teaching.

00:06:16.425 --> 00:06:19.761
There are some areas
where Aoi is a lousy fighter.

00:06:35.235 --> 00:06:37.029
It's unscientific.

00:06:39.239 --> 00:06:42.868
"Some technology that you can't
explain got you down, Master?"

00:06:43.285 --> 00:06:46.830
I'm not quite as dogmatic as our superiors.

00:06:46.914 --> 00:06:50.751
The fact of the matter is,
our soldiers were intercepted.

00:06:50.834 --> 00:06:53.337
Although, these forces, which were
supposed to have been casualties,

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:56.214
carried out this mission all on their own.

00:06:56.298 --> 00:07:00.510
There were no new losses,
and we did retrieve some enemy data.

00:07:00.594 --> 00:07:03.639
There isn't a single thing to get me down.

00:07:03.722 --> 00:07:06.725
Our objective lies in forcing the cats

00:07:06.808 --> 00:07:09.895
to give up on establishing
relations with Earth.

00:07:09.978 --> 00:07:13.148
Having the Earthers give up
would have the same effect.

00:07:13.523 --> 00:07:14.983
"Do you have something in mind?"

00:07:15.484 --> 00:07:18.362
We just need to show both of
them that continuing their relationship

00:07:18.445 --> 00:07:22.115
is not in their best interests.
It's as simple as that.

00:07:23.158 --> 00:07:25.535
It's unscientific.

00:07:25.619 --> 00:07:27.579
Downright unscientific.

00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:32.501
"Don't think. Feel"

00:07:41.301 --> 00:07:42.678
| give!

00:07:42.761 --> 00:07:44.471
Are you all right, Kakazu?

00:07:44.554 --> 00:07:48.225
Ooof... It's not that easy to pick up, huh?

00:07:48.308 --> 00:07:49.935
Still, you're getting the hang of it.

00:07:50.018 --> 00:07:52.396
If you practice more,
| think you'll get good at it.

00:07:52.479 --> 00:07:54.898
Shall we take a little break?

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:00.946
I'm exhausted.

00:08:02.239 --> 00:08:05.951
So, why do you want to learn how
to fight all of a sudden?

00:08:06.034 --> 00:08:09.579
Well, I'm not any help at all.

00:08:09.663 --> 00:08:11.415
And of course, since I'm a guy,

00:08:11.498 --> 00:08:14.584
| feel that I have to be able to defend
everyone when the time comes.

00:08:14.668 --> 00:08:16.086
Not at all.

00:08:16.169 --> 00:08:20.757
Besides, each of you has something,
and I think it's amazing.

00:08:20.841 --> 00:08:23.010
Something... as in...?

00:08:23.802 --> 00:08:28.181
Eris travels through space,
and is now an attaché to Earth.

00:08:28.265 --> 00:08:32.144
Manami was trying to get a
job as an employee on the base.

00:08:32.227 --> 00:08:34.187
It was with the CIA, though.

00:08:35.272 --> 00:08:38.734
And Futaba, you held down
a dangerous job in secret, right?

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:46.867
Everyone has this great job,
or wants to do something great. But...

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.661
...I still don't have anything like that.

00:08:50.912 --> 00:08:52.998
There's no need to force
yourself to have something,

00:08:53.081 --> 00:08:55.751
if it's something you don't need to have.

00:08:57.002 --> 00:09:01.339
I was abandoned by my family
because of my power, after all.

00:09:03.258 --> 00:09:04.634
Huh?

00:09:04.885 --> 00:09:06.720
Come to think of it, where's Manami?

00:09:06.803 --> 00:09:07.512
Oh...

00:09:07.554 --> 00:09:11.850
There's just no helping her.
She's the one who suggested we train.

00:09:20.525 --> 00:09:23.361
Throughout the long history of Ryukyu,

00:09:24.654 --> 00:09:28.200
--there has always been delicious water.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.327
--Welcome home. Eris, you want some zenzai, too?
--there has always been delicious water.

00:09:30.327 --> 00:09:32.120
--Welcome home. Eris, you want some zenzai, too?
--Zuisen.

00:09:33.872 --> 00:09:34.164
--It's wild!

00:09:34.164 --> 00:09:36.958
--What are you doing, Manami?
--It's wild!

00:09:36.958 --> 00:09:38.210
--What am I doing? Taking a little break.
--It's wild!

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:39.503
--What am I doing? Taking a little break.
--The flavor is rich and wild!

00:09:39.503 --> 00:09:40.629
--A break? You haven't trained at all, have you?
--The flavor is rich and wild!

00:09:40.629 --> 00:09:42.798
--A break? You haven't trained at all, have you?
--Blue Orion, Southern Star!

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:46.510
Yeah, well, I thought it
wouldn't be right to interfere

00:09:46.593 --> 00:09:49.513
with Kio's training,
and the mood was so nice, and all...

00:09:49.596 --> 00:09:50.847
Manami...

00:09:50.931 --> 00:09:54.559
It's okay, it's okay. I'll be along later.

00:09:57.938 --> 00:09:59.898
What are you doing?!

00:09:59.981 --> 00:10:01.650
You leave yourself wide open.

00:10:01.733 --> 00:10:04.861
If that had been a real bullet,
you'd be dead now.

00:10:04.945 --> 00:10:07.280
No, I wouldn't be dead.

00:10:07.364 --> 00:10:09.616
You didn't have any time to dodge me.

00:10:09.699 --> 00:10:14.204
| didn't need to dodge you.
| knew you weren't aiming at me.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:18.708
You can't shoot a revolver
if you grip it here, huh?

00:10:32.681 --> 00:10:34.141
Apport!

00:10:36.351 --> 00:10:38.645
No fair! I really liked this bra!

00:10:38.728 --> 00:10:40.981
Nothing is unfair in an actual fight.

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:45.235
How dare you!

00:10:49.698 --> 00:10:51.074
"Taye it 9asy"

00:10:51.158 --> 00:10:53.201
"Lot's all be freinds"

00:10:54.244 --> 00:10:56.538
Fine. Let's have it out.

00:10:56.621 --> 00:10:58.832
An ordinary contest would be boring.

00:10:58.915 --> 00:11:02.669
How about if whoever loses has
to do one thing the winner says to?

00:11:02.752 --> 00:11:04.296
| don't mind.

00:11:04.379 --> 00:11:08.091
No hard feelings. Just a fair fight.

00:11:08.175 --> 00:11:10.594
What's going on, you two?

00:11:11.887 --> 00:11:13.889
You're always, always doing this!

00:11:13.972 --> 00:11:16.808
Ah! S-Stop! That hurts, Manami!

00:11:27.485 --> 00:11:29.070
"Your order has arrived"

00:11:29.446 --> 00:11:33.575
Best to let the Earthlings deal
with the Earthlings.

00:11:36.703 --> 00:11:38.496
Cat Planet Cuties.

00:11:57.182 --> 00:11:58.141
Tactical exercises?

00:11:58.225 --> 00:11:59.142
Yes.

00:11:59.226 --> 00:12:02.854
Manami and I will be conducting
them under near-combat conditions.

00:12:05.106 --> 00:12:08.026
By any chance,
is this what's called a duel?

00:12:08.109 --> 00:12:10.695
It's practice. It's just practice.

00:12:10.779 --> 00:12:13.365
Being out in nature will be good training.

00:12:53.321 --> 00:12:56.658
Right around here is
the area with the best view.

00:12:56.741 --> 00:13:01.121
I'm sure she must be lying in
wait on this hill for me to pass by.

00:13:01.204 --> 00:13:03.957
In that case, I'll outmaneuver her.

00:13:08.962 --> 00:13:11.798
Manami will think that I'm
lying in wait for her on the hill,

00:13:11.881 --> 00:13:14.634
and try to come around from behind.

00:13:14.718 --> 00:13:17.971
The question is, which way
will she be coming around from?

00:13:19.055 --> 00:13:22.434
To the south is the river,
where she won't be able to move.

00:13:22.517 --> 00:13:25.895
She'll move from the north,
where it will be easy for her to hide.

00:13:25.979 --> 00:13:28.189
Then that's where I'll aim.

00:13:32.068 --> 00:13:35.488
The area around here
is like my own front yard.

00:13:35.572 --> 00:13:37.115
Like the road I traveled many times,

00:13:37.198 --> 00:13:40.243
when my father took me survival training.

00:13:40.994 --> 00:13:43.830
I've got the upper hand in this fight.

00:13:51.921 --> 00:13:53.590
This is an ideal opportunity.

00:13:53.673 --> 00:13:57.218
I needed to have a
sharp word with Manami.

00:13:57.302 --> 00:14:00.764
If she takes on a mission
while she still needs to be coddled...

00:14:00.847 --> 00:14:03.224
...then at some point, she'll get killed.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:12.650
Man, Aoi has no
idea what my feelings are.

00:14:13.735 --> 00:14:17.697
Manami doesn't really know how I feel.

00:14:21.034 --> 00:14:22.786
Doesn't she get that I've been getting

00:14:22.869 --> 00:14:24.954
her and Kio alone together?

00:14:25.872 --> 00:14:30.168
She doesn't seem to understand that.
She can be so dense sometimes.

00:14:31.127 --> 00:14:33.880
I am a pro in this line of work.

00:14:33.963 --> 00:14:36.800
I've performed many
extralegal missions, after all.

00:14:37.759 --> 00:14:43.848
Which is why someone like Kakazu
really shouldn't be involved with me.

00:14:44.641 --> 00:14:48.436
It's too late for me, anyhow.

00:14:49.354 --> 00:14:52.315
I've let my chance
with Kio get away from me.

00:15:03.952 --> 00:15:05.078
Rain?

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:09.416
Should I move now,
while I won't be detected?

00:15:09.499 --> 00:15:10.959
Or instead...

00:15:12.752 --> 00:15:17.674
I can't make my move anymore, huh?

00:15:19.384 --> 00:15:22.220
At this point, it's too late.

00:15:29.602 --> 00:15:32.939
I wonder why I didn't realize it sooner.

00:15:34.649 --> 00:15:36.025
That I...

00:15:37.152 --> 00:15:39.195
...love Kio...

00:15:45.952 --> 00:15:47.787
It's really starting to come down.

00:15:47.871 --> 00:15:50.582
Are Aoi and Manami all right?

00:15:51.833 --> 00:15:53.126
I've got it!

00:15:53.209 --> 00:15:56.296
Would you give me a hand, Sadayan?

00:16:21.404 --> 00:16:25.492
An Okinawa rail? The rain must
have changed its watering hole.

00:16:26.784 --> 00:16:29.746
Whoops. That gunfire gave away my position.

00:16:29.829 --> 00:16:31.831
You're quick to respond, Aoi.

00:16:32.415 --> 00:16:35.376
| missed? Don't tell me she evaded me.

00:16:37.712 --> 00:16:39.088
She's fast!

00:16:49.557 --> 00:16:50.767
Oh, crap!

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:53.603
Why, you... why, you...
I'll strip you naked!

00:17:15.875 --> 00:17:17.335
It's a draw.

00:17:17.418 --> 00:17:19.546
Your bluff won't work on me.

00:17:21.464 --> 00:17:22.882
Aren't you going to shoot?

00:17:22.966 --> 00:17:26.344
I'm impressed that you
realized that I'm out of ammo.

00:17:27.637 --> 00:17:29.764
| counted them all.

00:17:29.847 --> 00:17:32.559
You can thank our
endangered species for that.

00:17:32.642 --> 00:17:37.814
Well then, as promised, how about
you do something I tell you to do?

00:17:37.897 --> 00:17:40.984
| don't have much choice.
What do you want?

00:17:41.067 --> 00:17:45.530
Let's see... How about,
once we get back, you give Kio a kiss?

00:17:45.613 --> 00:17:47.574
A-A kiss?!

00:17:47.657 --> 00:17:50.702
Yep. A nice, tender one.

00:17:50.785 --> 00:17:53.871
| can't! No! No way!

00:17:53.955 --> 00:17:56.457
Our terms were to do whatever
the winner says, weren't they?

00:17:56.541 --> 00:17:58.543
I'm sorry. Forgive me.

00:17:58.626 --> 00:18:01.546
Oh well. I guess I can lower the hurdle a bit.

00:18:01.629 --> 00:18:04.132
Okay, how about you
change the way you address Kio?

00:18:04.215 --> 00:18:05.466
The way I address him?

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:10.888
"Kakazu..." Don't address him
so impersonally, okay? Let's see...

00:18:12.098 --> 00:18:13.975
How about just calling him Kio?

00:18:14.058 --> 00:18:15.768
No! I couldn't!

00:18:15.852 --> 00:18:17.186
Listen to me,

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:20.189
unless you do, the distance
between you will never shrink.

00:18:20.273 --> 00:18:22.066
This is an order!

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:26.237
But, Manami, are you sure?

00:18:26.321 --> 00:18:28.615
A-About what?

00:18:28.698 --> 00:18:32.368
| mean, the truth is, Manami, you, too...

00:18:33.745 --> 00:18:35.121
Get down!

00:18:41.919 --> 00:18:45.465
It was an infrared laser sight.
| can see them with these glasses.

00:18:45.548 --> 00:18:47.592
Was that a live round?
Where did it come from?

00:18:47.675 --> 00:18:49.135
5 o'clock.

00:18:56.184 --> 00:18:58.561
Judging by the report and its impact,

00:18:58.645 --> 00:19:00.229
they're out about 300 meters.

00:19:00.313 --> 00:19:04.108
Hell of a shot from that distance,
in all these obstructions.

00:19:04.192 --> 00:19:08.696
Either they're very sure of their aim,
or they're very deliberate.

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:11.616
What do we do? We have to
be careful how we move.

00:19:11.699 --> 00:19:13.034
| have an idea.

00:19:13.117 --> 00:19:15.536
One of us is the lure,
and one of us is the shooter?

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:18.873
No. You are the lure and
you are the shooter.

00:19:18.956 --> 00:19:20.124
Huh?

00:19:33.638 --> 00:19:35.014
Found you!

00:20:07.505 --> 00:20:09.090
We're home.

00:20:09.173 --> 00:20:12.009
Welcome back, Manami and Futaba.

00:20:12.093 --> 00:20:14.887
Such troopers! Dinner is ready.

00:20:15.888 --> 00:20:18.057
It looks so good!

00:20:18.141 --> 00:20:19.934
Kio, did you make this?

00:20:20.017 --> 00:20:24.230
No, most of it was these
little guys helping out.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:24.313
"Not at all" No, most of it was
these little guys helping out.

00:20:24.313 --> 00:20:25.857
"Not at all"

00:20:26.232 --> 00:20:29.193
Kio said we should make a hot meal,

00:20:29.277 --> 00:20:32.321
since you two must have
gotten chilled from the rain.

00:20:33.531 --> 00:20:36.033
That's pretty considerate,
coming from you, Kio.

00:20:36.117 --> 00:20:38.745
Thank you, Kakazu--

00:20:38.828 --> 00:20:39.912
Yow!

00:20:39.996 --> 00:20:41.414
That's not it, right?

00:20:42.415 --> 00:20:43.332
Er...

00:20:43.416 --> 00:20:46.127
K-- K--

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:47.128
Kio...

00:20:47.211 --> 00:20:48.254
There.

00:20:48.337 --> 00:20:50.506
Ki wo tsukatte kurete, arigato--
("Thanks for being so considerate")

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:52.675
Thank you, Kio!

00:20:52.759 --> 00:20:56.304
It's not that big a deal.
Didn't you get cold?

00:20:56.387 --> 00:20:57.138
--Huh?

00:20:57.138 --> 00:20:58.306
--Not at all.
--Huh?

00:20:58.389 --> 00:21:02.602
K-Kio, we just didn't
expect you to cook.

00:21:03.478 --> 00:21:07.023
You idiot! Don't you realize
how hard Aoi is trying?!

00:21:07.899 --> 00:21:10.318
Well, eat up before it gets cold.

00:21:10.401 --> 00:21:12.195
Thank you, Kio.

00:21:14.238 --> 00:21:15.782
It's delicious!

00:21:18.326 --> 00:21:22.246
Enough, already!
Could you be any more dense?!

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:25.833
Huh? What? What are you mad at, Manami?

00:21:25.917 --> 00:21:29.754
What's the matter, Manami?
Did you not like the food?

00:21:29.837 --> 00:21:31.881
It's not that!

00:21:31.964 --> 00:21:34.342
Manami, it's all right.

00:21:34.425 --> 00:21:36.344
Aoi, you could jump in here, too!

00:21:36.427 --> 00:21:40.890
| give, I give! I get it!
| get it, already! Forgive me!

00:21:42.183 --> 00:21:47.313
You don't get a thing!

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:12.088
| called forth the inevitable

00:22:12.171 --> 00:22:17.093
to guide me toward your light

00:22:17.176 --> 00:22:21.389
In the unyielding rain of my heartbeat

00:22:21.472 --> 00:22:26.352
I'm here all by myself

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:32.275
just searching for an unending dream,

00:22:32.358 --> 00:22:37.446
passing through the moment

00:22:38.531 --> 00:22:43.369
If there is a tomorrow

00:22:43.452 --> 00:22:48.583
that knows the breadth of the sky

00:22:48.666 --> 00:22:53.880
then I will blaze my way through any darkness

00:22:53.963 --> 00:22:58.259
here at the windowsill of my heart

00:22:58.342 --> 00:23:03.180
My wishes swimming through

00:23:03.264 --> 00:23:08.436
the waves of my sighs

00:23:08.519 --> 00:23:14.191
chase after the miracle that spells out

00:23:14.275 --> 00:23:21.741
a story that no one knows

00:23:28.372 --> 00:23:30.041
The time is the future,
the place is outer space,

00:23:30.124 --> 00:23:31.959
and ethereal winds fill the sails.

00:23:32.043 --> 00:23:35.838
Straddling the galaxy, the dream
they deliver is the one you love.

00:23:35.922 --> 00:23:39.383
Next time,
"The Grand First Assistroid?”

00:23:39.467 --> 00:23:41.969
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:47.433
"See you next time!"
